ively search the grounds which  leads him to getting caught he manages  to outrun one but its calls to the rest  of the pack allow them to quickly swarm  the door break it down and take bob as  their midnight snack they probably would  have been better off with the three  musketeers bar though  [Music]  chief hopper tries to shoot them down  but they're also bulletproof luckily  they're too engrossed in their meal to  care everyone regroups at the buyer's  house where they have their realization  about the hive mind and determined that  the best way to beat the army of  demidogs is to destroy the shadow  monster which acts as the brain of the  super organism they try to question will  in an ambiguous location but the mind  player is still able to find out where  they are and send the demo dogs their  way just as the first one shows up so  does the completely overpowered  psychokinetic girl 11. she snaps its  neck and tosses it through the buyer's  window for some reason that's actually  kind of rude i mean i hope she pays for  that the group splits up for a plan to  try to break the mind flare's influence  on will by closing the gates to the  upside down where a massive horde of  demidogs is now festering steve mike  dustin max and lucas stay at the house  after putting the dead demi dog in the  buyer's freezer for scientific purposes  you're explaining this mrs byers all  right they realize they can use the hive  mind to their advantage by creating a  distraction so that the dogs  so that the demi dogs are drawn away  from the lab thus creating an easier  path for eleven to get to the gates of  the upside down and destroy it or at  least close it they plan to do this by  starting a fire in the underground  tunnels using will's map they locate the  area where they think is the main hub  where all of the upside down tentacle  things are and cover it with gasoline  steve lights the area on fire which  causes a great deal of pain to those  tentacles and as a result every creature  that is part of the hive mind the demand  dogs at the gate all go crazy and the  mind flayer prioritizes putting a stop  to the fire so they all clear out of the  gate area steve and the kids run for the  exits but they come face to face with  none other than dart  start  [Music]  with the hub now on fire dart's newest  task was to take out any danger to the  pack by following the sounds of dustin's  group dart was the first to track them  down and face the boy who betrayed him  less than 36 hours ago let's just play  it back one more time  they slowly approach each other and the  two share a moment where dustin  apologizes for knocking dart into the  cellar and offers a three musketeers to  smooth things over and distract him long  enough for everyone else to sneak by  there are a couple notable things about  this scene the first is that the mind  flayer doesn't seem to have as much  control over dart as it has over the  others and dart is still able to make  decisions on his own the second is that  it almost seems like dart is wired  differently than the others having  developed a greater taste for chocolate  than it has for human flesh maybe dart  associates that taste with its youth the  same way that we always have a  preference for mom's home cooking in the  end dartanian chose to eat the three  musketeers rather than following the  mindflare's orders and in that sense he  lived up to his namesake from the three  musketeers novel one of the central  themes of the novel is this idea of all  for one versus one for all and dartanya  is forced to decide between being a  king's musketeer or part of his group of  friends known as the inseparables in  stranger things loyalty to the hive mind  represents the idea of one for all but  loyalty to his friend dustin who took  him in and fed him early on is an  example of all for one despite dustin's  repeated insistence that a demi dog is  not a dog their final meeting is  reminiscent of the saying goodbye to 